# AI harness tooling. Impeccable vendors ~3MB of skill files into .claude, and
# settings.local.json is per-developer by design. Install it per checkout with
# `npx impeccable install --providers=claude --scope=project` rather than
# committing it. Drop a negation here if a shared .claude/settings.json is ever
# wanted in the repo.
.claude/
